17
00:00:53.466 --> 00:00:55.473
traditional machine learning
supervised learning applications

18
00:00:55.473 --> 00:00:58.818
is because you can build such
an application so quickly,

19
00:00:58.818 --> 00:01:02.163
the methods for evaluating it,
it tends not to start

20
00:01:02.163 --> 00:01:05.508
off with a test set. Instead,
you often end up

21
00:01:05.508 --> 00:01:08.184
