95
00:05:02.046 --> 00:05:04.787
risk of bias or
an inappropriate output causing

96
00:05:04.787 --> 00:05:07.871
harm to someone, then the
responsibility to collect a

97
00:05:07.871 --> 00:05:10.612
test set to rigorously
evaluate the performance of

98
00:05:10.612 --> 00:05:14.724
your system to make
sure it's doing the right thing before you

99
00:05:14.724 --> 00:05:18.150
use it, that becomes much
more important. But if, for

100
00:05:18.150 --> 00:05:20.892
example, if you are
using it to summarize

